       <item row="4" column="0" colspan="5">
        <widget class="DKFormPicker" name="teachSpell">
         <property name="whatsThis">
          <string>&lt;p&gt;A book can optionally be configured to increase one of the player's skills when they read it for the first time, or to teach the player a new spell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note that if a book is set to teach a spell (i.e. if it's a Spell Tome), then the player won't be able to see the text of the book. If they try to use the book, it will either be consumed instantly (if the player doesn't already know the spell) or fail to activate.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
